==Party changes==
===Additions===
The following Pokémon are obtained:
* Blue's {{p|Porygon}} in [[PS018]].
* Red's {{p|Diglett}} in [[PS018]].
* Red's {{p|Krabby}} in [[PS018]].
* Blue's {{p|Ninetales}} in [[PS018]].
* Red's {{p|Eevee}} "[[Vee]]" in [[PS019]].
* Red obtains several Pokémon from the Safari Zone in [[PS022]].
* Red's {{p|Sandshrew}} sometime between [[PS022]] and [[PS023]].
* Red's {{p|Gyarados}} "[[Gyara]]" in [[PS025]].
* Red's {{p|Aerodactyl}} "[[Aero]]" in [[PS026]].

===Evolutions===
The following Pokémon evolve:
* Red's {{p|Bulbasaur}} "[[Saur]]" evolves into {{p|Ivysaur}} in [[PS015]].
* Blue's {{p|Machoke}} evolves into {{p|Machamp}} in [[PS018]].
* Blue's {{p|Charmeleon}} evolves into {{TP|Blue|Charizard}} sometime between [[PS018]] and [[PS027]].

==Gym battles==
Red obtains the Badges from the following Gym Leaders:
* [[Erika]] in [[PS020]]
* [[Blaine]] in [[PS026]]

==Character summary==
This is Red's Pokédex information and party at the end of this volume.

