==Trivia==

* The map of [[Red (Adventures)|Red]]'s journey shows him take an underground path not in the games. He may have found it in the [[Rock Tunnel]] based on his trajectory suddenly changing once he reaches said location.

===Errors===
====VIZ Media second edition====
* In the overview of {{adv|Red}}'s party at the end of the book, [[Snor]]'s nickname is mistakenly listed as "Lax". This also happens in the [[Pokémon Adventures volume 3|next volume]].
* The About the Author section states that [[Mato]] was born in {{wp|Aichi Prefecture}} while she was, in fact, born in {{wp|Ehime Prefecture}}.


